{
  "esm": "2.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "heat_column_varcoeff_forced_tracer",
    "description": "MMS driver for grids/column_nonuniform_1d_tracer/rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc_tracer with a GENUINELY VARIABLE interface coefficient and UNEQUAL, time-dependent per-tracer face fluxes -- the tracer-axis twin of problems/heat_column_varcoeff_forced, built so that the index slips the constant-K, equal-flux problems/heat_column_varcoeff_flux_bc_tracer cannot see are O(1) errors here. u_t = d/dz(K du/dz) + S on the unit column [0, 1] for TWO tracers, u shaped [lev, tracer] with NTRACER = 2 bound at the rule's import edge, on the grid's shared quadratic-stretch MMS column, with the shared interface coefficient K(z) = 1 + z (K[kn] = 1 + ze[kn]). Tracer s carries its own manufactured solution u_s(z,t) = exp(-t) ( p_s z + q_s sin(pi z) + r_s cos(pi z) ) with p = (1, -2), q = (1, 0.5), r = (0, 1) (spelled p_s = 4 - 3s, q_s = 1.5 - s/2, r_s = s - 1; model-local templates mms_p / mms_q / mms_r / mms_exact). Then K u_z = (1+z) exp(-t) ( p_s + pi q_s cos(pi z) - pi r_s sin(pi z) ) (mms_flux), so the prescribed face fluxes are the [tracer] observeds kdudz_bot[s] = mms_flux(0, s, t) = exp(-t) (p_s + pi q_s) and kdudz_top[s] = mms_flux(1, s, t) = 2 exp(-t) (p_s - pi q_s): about (4.14, -0.43) exp(-t) at the surface and (-4.28, -7.14) exp(-t) at the top -- different at the two faces of each tracer and different between the tracers. The forcing is S_s = u_t - d/dz(K u_z) = -u_s - exp(-t) ( p_s + q_s (pi cos(pi z) - pi^2 (1+z) sin(pi z)) - r_s (pi sin(pi z) + pi^2 (1+z) cos(pi z)) ) (mms_forcing), evaluated at the runtime layer centres zc. Detected slips: reading K[n-1] for K[n] (K varies by dz across an interface, an O(dz) relative change of every flux, an O(1) change of the divergence); swapping the two face fluxes (bottom and top differ in sign and size); reading another tracer's face flux or field (the tracers' solutions and fluxes differ). Nothing is discretely exact and the column totals are not conserved (the faces carry net flux and S is nonzero), so the t = 0.1 relative L2 error over the [lev, tracer] field is the full second-order spatial error of the scheme. The mesh follows the column grid's edge-array contract (ze = mms_column_ze of grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column.esm; zc and dz grid-derived). The ic applies the closed per-layer centre template mms_column_zc (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column_centre.esm) inside its aggregate over [lev, tracer]; the 6.6.5 test references spell the layer centre inline from literals and NLEV, because the inline-test oracle does not resolve template references.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d_tracer",
      "equation:heat",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "Heat": {
      "expression_template_imports": [
        {
          "ref": "../grids/column_nonuniform_1d_tracer/rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_flux_bc_tracer.esm",
          "bindings": { "NTRACER": 2 }
        },
        { "ref": "../grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column.esm" },
        { "ref": "../grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column_centre.esm" }
      ],
      "expression_templates": {
        "mms_p": {
          "params": ["s"],
          "description": "Ramp coefficient of tracer s: p_s = 4 - 3s, (1, -2).",
          "body": { "op": "-", "args": [4.0, { "op": "*", "args": [3.0, "s"] }] }
        },
        "mms_q": {
          "params": ["s"],
          "description": "Sine coefficient of tracer s: q_s = 1.5 - s/2, (1, 0.5).",
          "body": { "op": "-", "args": [1.5, { "op": "*", "args": [0.5, "s"] }] }
        },
        "mms_r": {
          "params": ["s"],
          "description": "Cosine coefficient of tracer s: r_s = s - 1, (0, 1).",
          "body": { "op": "-", "args": ["s", 1.0] }
        },
        "mms_exact": {
          "params": ["z", "s", "t"],
          "description": "Manufactured solution of tracer s: u_s(z,t) = exp(-t) (p_s z + q_s sin(pi z) + r_s cos(pi z)).",
          "body": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              { "op": "exp", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["t"] }] },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_p", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                      "z"
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_q", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                      { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_r", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                      { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "mms_flux": {
          "params": ["z", "s", "t"],
          "description": "Diffusive flux of tracer s, K u_z = (1+z) exp(-t) (p_s + pi q_s cos(pi z) - pi r_s sin(pi z)), positive upward.",
          "body": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              { "op": "+", "args": [1.0, "z"] },
              { "op": "exp", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["t"] }] },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_p", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          3.141592653589793,
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_q", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                          { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      3.141592653589793,
                      { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_r", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                      { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "mms_forcing": {
          "params": ["z", "s", "t"],
          "description": "Manufactured forcing of tracer s: S_s = u_t - d/dz((1+z) u_z) = -u_s - exp(-t) ( p_s + q_s (pi cos(pi z) - pi^2 (1+z) sin(pi z)) - r_s (pi sin(pi z) + pi^2 (1+z) cos(pi z)) ).",
          "body": {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_exact", "bindings": { "z": "z", "s": "s", "t": "t" } }
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "exp", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["t"] }] },
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "+",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_p", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_q", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                              {
                                "op": "-",
                                "args": [
                                  { "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }] },
                                  {
                                    "op": "*",
                                    "args": [
                                      9.869604401089358,
                                      { "op": "+", "args": [1.0, "z"] },
                                      { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_r", "bindings": { "s": "s" } },
                          {
                            "op": "+",
                            "args": [
                              { "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }] },
                              {
                                "op": "*",
                                "args": [
                                  9.869604401089358,
                                  { "op": "+", "args": [1.0, "z"] },
                                  { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": ["lev", "tracer"],
          "description": "Two tracers over the lev (layer) axis."
        },
        "K": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m^2/s",
          "shape": ["lev_nodes"],
          "description": "Interface diffusivity K = 1 + z on the interfaces, K[kn] = 1 + ze[kn], shared by both tracers."
        },
        "S": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K/s",
          "shape": ["lev", "tracer"],
          "description": "Manufactured forcing mms_forcing(zc, s, t), per tracer."
        },
        "kdudz_bot": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K m/s",
          "shape": ["tracer"],
          "description": "Prescribed K du/dz on the surface interface, per tracer: mms_flux(0, s, t) = exp(-t) (p_s + pi q_s)."
        },
        "kdudz_top": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K m/s",
          "shape": ["tracer"],
          "description": "Prescribed K du/dz on the top interface, per tracer: mms_flux(1, s, t) = 2 exp(-t) (p_s - pi q_s)."
        },
        "ze": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "shape": ["lev_nodes"],
          "description": "Interface coordinates of the quadratic-stretch column, the shared mms_column_ze."
        },
        "zc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "shape": ["lev"],
          "description": "Layer centres, grid-derived by column_cell_center."
        },
        "dz": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "shape": ["lev"],
          "description": "Layer thicknesses, grid-derived by column_cell_thickness."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": { "op": "ic", "args": ["u"] },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "s"],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" }, "s": { "from": "tracer" } },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mms_exact",
              "bindings": {
                "z": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_column_zc", "bindings": { "i": "i" } },
                "s": "s",
                "t": 0.0
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": { "op": "D", "args": ["u"], "wrt": "t" },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "D",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": ["K", { "op": "D", "args": ["u"], "wrt": "lev" }] }
                ],
                "wrt": "lev"
              },
              "S"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "K",
          "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": [1.0, "ze"] }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "S",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "s"],
            "args": ["zc"],
            "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" }, "s": { "from": "tracer" } },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mms_forcing",
              "bindings": { "z": { "op": "index", "args": ["zc", "i"] }, "s": "s", "t": "t" }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "kdudz_bot",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["s"],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": { "s": { "from": "tracer" } },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mms_flux",
              "bindings": { "z": 0.0, "s": "s", "t": "t" }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "kdudz_top",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["s"],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": { "s": { "from": "tracer" } },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_expression_template",
              "args": [],
              "name": "mms_flux",
              "bindings": { "z": 1.0, "s": "s", "t": "t" }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "ze",
          "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "mms_column_ze", "bindings": {} }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "zc",
          "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "column_cell_center", "bindings": { "ze": "ze" } }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dz",
          "rhs": { "op": "apply_expression_template", "args": [], "name": "column_cell_thickness", "bindings": { "ze": "ze" } }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_column_forced_tracer",
          "description": "Two manufactured solutions u_s(z,t) = exp(-t) (p_s z + q_s sin(pi z) + r_s cos(pi z)), p = (1, -2), q = (1, 0.5), r = (0, 1), with K = 1 + z on the interfaces, the matching per-tracer forcing and the per-tracer prescribed face fluxes K u_z at z = 0 and z = 1 (unequal at the two faces and between tracers), on the quadratic-stretch column. The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring; the t=0.1 assertion bounds the relative L2 error over the [lev, tracer] field at the default NLEV = 64 (second-order; per-resolution values pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/heat_column_varcoeff_forced_tracer/golden/errors.json).",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.1 },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-09 },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "faq",
                "output_idx": ["i", "s"],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" }, "s": { "from": "tracer" } },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    1.0,
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "-", "args": [4.0, { "op": "*", "args": [3.0, "s"] }] },
                            {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "-", "args": [1.5, { "op": "*", "args": [0.5, "s"] }] },
                            { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}] }] }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "-", "args": ["s", 1.0] },
                            { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}] }] }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.1,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": { "abs": 0.00025 },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "faq",
                "output_idx": ["i", "s"],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" }, "s": { "from": "tracer" } },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    0.9048374180359595,
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "-", "args": [4.0, { "op": "*", "args": [3.0, "s"] }] },
                            {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "-", "args": [1.5, { "op": "*", "args": [0.5, "s"] }] },
                            { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}] }] }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            { "op": "-", "args": ["s", 1.0] },
                            { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}] }] }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
